{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is detected, approach, check properties, grab, carry, then scan until next detection. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CarryObjectTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
